[00:30.94] Haïti, mon pays
[00:35.08] Wounded mother I'll never see
[00:39.96] Ma famille set me free
[00:44.53] Throw my ashes into the sea
[01:09.01] Mes cousins jamais nés
[01:13.50] Hantent les nuits de Duvalier
[01:18.25] Rien n'arrête nos esprits
[01:23.16] Guns can't kill what soldiers can't see
[01:28.01] In the forest we are hiding
[01:32.66] Unmarked graves where flowers grow
[01:37.43] Hear the soldiers angry yelling
[01:42.42] In the river we will go
[02:44.41] Tous les morts-nés forment une armée
[02:49.75] Soon we will reclaim the earth
[02:54.38] All the tears and all the bodies
[02:59.22] Bring about our second birth
[03:03.12] Haiti, never free
[03:07.83] N'aie pas peur de sonner l'alarme
[03:13.72] Tes enfants sont partis
[03:18.52] In those days their blood was still warm